Package: solomonR
Title: Analyze Solomon Four-Group Designs (Classic & Modern)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Uhalt", email = "Josh.Uhalt@gmail.com", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: Tools to analyze Solomon Four-Group Designs (SFGD): 
    (a) the classic two-step workflow (2x2 posttest ANOVA + ANCOVA / t) with optional Stouffer Z 
    per Braver & Braver (1988), alongside cautions from later exchanges; 
    (b) a unified GLM/ANCOVA approach with robust SEs and permutation inference; 
    (c) power simulation helpers.
